Welcome to Thorn Engine!
A open source game engine that YOU can edit to YOUR liking!
(it is recommended that you have experience in python before editing this code)

Controls when running main.py:
~ to open system performance
Right click and drag to move the camera
W, A, S, and D to move around
Q to move up
E to move down

